{"prototypeToken":{"displayName":20,"displayBars":20,"flags":{"pf2e":{"linkToActorSize":true,"autoscale":false}},"height":1,"width":1,"name":"Adada","actorLink":false,"texture":{"src":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/tokens/adada.webp","scaleX":2,"scaleY":2,"tint":"#ffffff","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"bar1":{"attribute":"attributes.hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":null},"light":{"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1},"negative":false,"priority":0},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":true,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":2,"texture":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/subjects/adada.webp"}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"depth":1},"name":"Adada","type":"npc","effects":[],"system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":415,"temp":0,"max":415,"details":""},"ac":{"value":39,"details":""},"allSaves":{"value":""},"speed":{"value":50,"otherSpeeds":[{"type":"burrow","value":35},{"type":"fly","value":40},{"type":"swim","value":35}],"details":"freedom of movement"},"immunities":[{"type":"confused","exceptions":[]},{"type":"controlled","exceptions":[]}],"weaknesses":[]},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":[],"details":"tongue of nonsense"},"level":{"value":17},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>When convention and mandated structure crush the dreams of artists who would otherwise become once-in-a lifetime talents, the collective frustration from this loss spawns or attracts a terrifying creature of meaninglessness, an adada. Adadas spread unconventionality and irregular artistic visions in their wake, often causing calamitous damage as a side effect. Only the truly foolish would think to summon an unpredictable adada by design.</p>\n<h2>Unfathomable Beings</h2>\n<p>Adadas are not malign creatures, but they have little to no regard for lives and property that they may ruin for the sake of their mission. But though their careless disregard can make them terrifying destroyers, they can also become unconventional saviors by battling tyrannical forces trying to dictate aesthetic sensibilities. At the same time, an adada might attract rival powers. When an adada clashes with one of its nemeses, the results are often more devastating than the emergence of either creature alone.</p>\n<h2>Suggested Monster Parts</h2>\n<p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 1,875/4,300/8,000 gp</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> weapons (piercing, slashing), armor (light, medium), perception item, skill items (Arcana, Athletics, Crafting, Lore [Art], Performance)</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> bane, chaotic, charisma, constitution, dexterity, elongating, energy resistant (positive), intelligence, spells (Divine: freedom of movement, mind blank, teleport), strength, wild, winged</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary: Strange and Unusual","authors":"Juho Kattelus","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"creatureType":""},"resources":{},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"abilities":{"str":{"mod":9},"dex":{"mod":6},"con":{"mod":9},"int":{"mod":6},"wis":{"mod":6},"cha":{"mod":9}},"perception":{"details":"","mod":29,"senses":[{"type":"darkvision"},{"type":"tremorsense","acuity":"imprecise","range":90}],"vision":true},"saves":{"fortitude":{"value":32,"saveDetail":""},"reflex":{"value":27,"saveDetail":""},"will"