ger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"type":"action","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"4.12.6","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1685479902097,"modifiedTime":1685479912117,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.j2wsK6IsW5yMW1jW","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"4NisyyoKnpSF1wki"},{"name":"Art Lore","type":"lore","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"mod":{"value":33},"proficient":{"value":0}},"effects":[],"_id":"AzKOaJZTJtVyf8PM","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/lore.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"4.12.6","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1685480329582,"modifiedTime":1685480338980,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Tongue of Nonsense","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Even though adadas babble nonsense, all creatures who can hear the adada can understand their babbling as the random sounds twist their brains into comprehending the meaning. Adadas understand all spoken and signed languages in the same way, converting language into something chaotic enough to process.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["divine"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"PphoPtCrSLl6uFAZ","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"4.12.6","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1685480409015,"modifiedTime":1685480435819,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Aura of Illogicality","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>60 feet. Creatures within range attempt a @Check[type:will|dc:35] save. On failure, the world melts into a chaotic morass of randomness and absurdity, causing the creature to become @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Stupefied]{Stupefied 2}. The flat check from this stupefied condition to avoid losing an action also applies to all actions using tools, weapons, or other objects, as the equipment's functionality sporadically becomes random and nonsensical. On a successful Will save, the creature is temporarily immune for 1 minute.</p>"},"rules":[{"key":"Aura","radius":60,"traits":["aura","divine"]}],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["aura","chaotic","divine"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"t5D4A0SQd1DxOhwW","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"4.12.6","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1685480495135,"modifiedTime":1685480684726,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Melt Time","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The adada becomes slowed or stunned</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong>: The adada attempts to counteract its @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed} and @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned} conditions (using its Performance modifier as its counteract modifier with a counteract level of 9). Regardless of whether it succeeds, it becomes @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Quickened]{Quickened} for 1 minute and can use the extra action to Strike, Stride, Burrow, Fly, or Swim.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["divine"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"RFIf1f5TboRXXA3U","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"4.12.6","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1685480613845,"modifiedTime":1685480668695,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Structure Vulnerability","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Unarmed attacks from creatures that follow a rigid code, such as tenets and anathemas trigger an adada's weakness to lawful damage, even if the creature isn't lawful.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaste